            "review_title": "Review at Cherry Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Sean\nEdinburgh, United Kingdom3 contributions\n0\nMasala Madness\nFeb 2016 • Friends\nGREAT if you're looking to drop some of those unwanted pounds for beach season. After ordering the chicken masala and going back my hotel to bed, I woke up about 2 hours later feeling average at best. I then spent the next 5 hours draped around the toilet clearing out the entire contents of my digestive tract. \n\nAsk to go to the toilet there as well, it's an experience :)\nRead more\nWritten February 22, 2016",
